Warm greetings to the Government and people of Colombia on their Independence Day.

@cancilleriacol 

🇮🇳🇨🇴

A pleasure to participate in the India - EU Business Roundtable today, alongside my ministerial colleagues, Minister - Presidents of Flanders and Wallonia, and business representatives from both countries.

Heartening to witness the energy and enthusiasm for deeper business, investment and R&D collaborations. 

Highlighted the growing trust and comfort in India’s partnership with Europe, now taken further by the India - EU FTA. And the importance for our businesses to meet the ambition and potential of this relationship. 

@matthiasdiependaele 
@adriendolimont 

🇮🇳 🇧🇪 🇪🇺

Congratulations to FM Maksim Ryzhenkov, the Government and people of the Republic of Belarus on their Independence Day.

@belarusmfa 

🇮🇳🇧🇾

Best wishes to our CARICOM partners as they celebrate their 53rd anniversary. 

Driven by shared solidarity and development aspirations, our partnership continues to move forward.

