With Netherlands FM David van Weel, DPM & FM @antoniotajani of Italy, Mohamad Haji Hasan of Malaysia, Bahrain FM Abdullatif bin Rashid Al Zayani, and FM Battsetseg Batmunkh of Mongolia before the start of the Ministerial. 

